DB-RESET.
    CALL "STCURSOR" USING ST-DB-RESULT END-CALL
    INITIALIZE ST-DB-REQUEST ST-DB-RESULT
    MOVE COMMAND-NAME TO DB-COMMAND.
ADD-NORMAL.
    ADD 1 TO DB-PARAMETER-COUNT
    MOVE DB-PARAMETER-COUNT TO P
    MOVE PARAM-TYPE TO DB-TYPE(P)
    MOVE N-NULL(PARAM-FIELD) TO DB-NULL(P)
    MOVE N-LENGTH(PARAM-FIELD) TO DB-LENGTH(P)
    SET DB-DATA(P) TO ADDRESS OF N-DATA(PARAM-FIELD).
ADD-RAW.
    ADD 1 TO DB-PARAMETER-COUNT
    MOVE DB-PARAMETER-COUNT TO P
    MOVE PARAM-TYPE TO DB-TYPE(P)
    MOVE R-NULL(PARAM-FIELD) TO DB-NULL(P)
    MOVE R-LENGTH(PARAM-FIELD) TO DB-LENGTH(P)
    SET DB-DATA(P) TO ADDRESS OF R-DATA(PARAM-FIELD).
ADD-TEMP.
    ADD 1 TO DB-PARAMETER-COUNT
    MOVE DB-PARAMETER-COUNT TO P
    MOVE PARAM-TYPE TO DB-TYPE(P)
    MOVE TMP-NULL TO DB-NULL(P)
    MOVE TMP-LENGTH TO DB-LENGTH(P)
    MOVE TMP-VALUE TO PARAM-VALUE(P)
    SET DB-DATA(P) TO ADDRESS OF PARAM-DATA(P).
DB-EXECUTE.
    CALL "STDBOP" USING BY VALUE DB-HANDLE
        BY REFERENCE ST-DB-REQUEST ST-DB-RESULT RETURNING RC
    END-CALL
    IF RC NOT = 0
        MOVE "SystemError" TO APP-OUTCOME
        MOVE 503 TO APP-STATUS
        MOVE "E-COM-004: 処理を完了できませんでした。" TO ERROR-TEXT
        PERFORM ADD-ERROR
    END-IF.
FETCH-TEMP.
    CALL "STCOLUMN" USING BY REFERENCE ST-DB-RESULT
        BY VALUE K BY REFERENCE TMP-VALUE RETURNING RC END-CALL
    IF RC NOT = 0
        MOVE "SystemError" TO APP-OUTCOME MOVE 503 TO APP-STATUS
    END-IF.
ADD-ERROR.
    IF APP-ERRORS-LENGTH < 7100
      STRING FUNCTION TRIM(ERROR-TEXT) X"0A"
        INTO APP-ERRORS WITH POINTER APP-ERRORS-LENGTH END-STRING
    END-IF
    IF APP-STATUS = 200
        MOVE 422 TO APP-STATUS MOVE "ValidationFailed" TO APP-OUTCOME
    END-IF.
ID-AS-TEMP.
    MOVE V TO ID-TEXT
    INITIALIZE TMP-VALUE
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(ID-TEXT) TO TMP-DATA
    COMPUTE TMP-LENGTH = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(ID-TEXT)).
ROLLBACK-UNIT.
    CALL "STCURSOR" USING ST-DB-RESULT END-CALL
    CALL "STEND" USING BY VALUE DB-HANDLE 0
        BY REFERENCE ST-DB-RESULT RETURNING RC END-CALL.
COMMIT-UNIT.
    CALL "STCURSOR" USING ST-DB-RESULT END-CALL
    MOVE 1 TO COMMIT-ATTEMPTED
    CALL "STEND" USING BY VALUE DB-HANDLE 1
        BY REFERENCE ST-DB-RESULT RETURNING RC END-CALL
    IF RC NOT = 0
        MOVE "Unknown" TO APP-OUTCOME MOVE 503 TO APP-STATUS
        MOVE "E-COM-004: 結果不明です。再送せず検索で結果を確認してください。"
          TO ERROR-TEXT PERFORM ADD-ERROR
    END-IF.
